{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"何西阿书","commonName":"何西阿书","title":"何西阿书","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"0fd01139d1173aab3c4eae9aadc1f8604860ccbde5e4b3d2c68eec56323410c3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["以色列和犹大不思悔改"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"“来吧，我们归向耶和华！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂撕裂我们，也必医治我们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂打伤我们，也必为我们包扎。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"过两天，祂必复兴我们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"第三天，祂必使我们站立起来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们好在祂面前存活。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让我们认识耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"竭力认识耶和华！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂如曙光一样必然出现，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必像甘霖一样临到我们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如滋润大地的春雨。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“以法莲啊，我该怎样待你呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹大啊，我该怎样待你呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们对我的爱像晨雾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如转瞬即逝的朝露。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我借先知砍碎你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用我的话杀戮你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的审判必如光临到你们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要的是怜悯，而非祭物；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我喜爱人认识我，胜于燔祭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可是，你们却如亚当一样背约，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以诡诈待我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"基列是罪恶之城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到处血迹斑斑。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祭司如同埋伏的强盗一样结伙打劫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在通往示剑的路上行凶作恶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在以色列家看见了可怕之事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲不忠不贞，玷污了自己。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"“犹大啊，当我使我被掳的子民返乡时，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必得到我给你定的下场","poem":1},{"noteId":12},{"text":"。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":12,"caller":"+","text":"“你必得到我给你定的下场”希伯来文是“我已经为你定下收割的时间”。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}